      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7220885784a76981a352a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“荒漠英雄以强劲的步伐踢着赛道，\n她坚持跑在笔直的道路上，完全不负英雄之名。\n无人能够追上她。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b18a8aeed7e55d53cac5e441eafe979832f9ec09b6cabc938cf4e0ae35bae08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
